  "aiContextParagraph": "A major fire has devastated the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory located in Cikande, Serang, resulting in numerous casualties and reports of missing employees. Emergency responders and search teams have been working to clear the site, which remains in a cooling phase due to residual heat and smoke. Forensic experts from the Banten Regional Police are currently managing the identification of retrieved remains, citing challenges in the process. In response to the tragedy, the Ministry of Manpower and other labor authorities have initiated investigations into the incident, including assessments of health and safety protocols at the facility. Local government officials have additionally ordered safety inspections across other industrial plants in the region. There have also been public calls from labor advocates for corporate accountability regarding the safety conditions that led to the event.",
